# personal files
personal/

# Crewon runtime state. This is what a running app writes -- sqlite databases,
# sessions, temp files, installed system skills -- not project source. It was
# tracked by accident: 5398 files, including a logs database that reached 1.1GB
# locally and blocks pushes to hosts that cap file size at 100MB.
#
# Listing individual paths here is what let it grow; the directory as a whole is
# generated, so ignore it as a whole.
.crewon/

# os
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Icon?
.Spotlight-V100/

# Unwanted package managers
.yarn/
yarn.lock

# release
package.json-e
session.ts-e
CHANGELOG.ignore.md
# Updater signing keys. The private key lives outside the repo and in GitHub
# secrets; a committed copy would let anyone sign an update this app installs.
*.key
!**/*.key.pub

# nix related
.direnv
.envrc

# Python bytecode files
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated by scripts/release-local.mjs at publish time.
latest.json
